WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.887
Week 24: Commands, Advice, and Procedures. give a safe procedure offer advice distinguish request from order

2
00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:16.159
Form and meaning. Tú, usted, ustedes, and nosotros commands; pronoun placement; negative commands; deber and conviene.

3
00:00:16.159 --> 00:00:41.734
Model set. Apague el equipo antes de abrirlo. No compartas esa contraseña. Asegúrense de guardar una copia. Comprobemos los datos otra vez. Conviene evitar este camino de noche. Turn off the equipment before opening it. Do not share that password. Make sure you save a copy. Let's check the data again. It is advisable to avoid this road at night.

4
00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:51.885
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:51.885 --> 00:01:03.935
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: give a safe procedure; offer advice; distinguish request from order. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:03.935 --> 00:01:30.428
Model language. Apague el equipo antes de abrirlo. — Turn off the equipment before opening it. No compartas esa contraseña. — Do not share that password. Asegúrense de guardar una copia. — Make sure you save a copy. Comprobemos los datos otra vez. — Let's check the data again. Conviene evitar este camino de noche. — It is advisable to avoid this road at night.

7
00:01:30.428 --> 00:01:40.326
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
